			"id":"406812c8a31afb9a",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"so. THE STATIONERS, painted as a shadowy organization think like maconic cult, in 2026, their master doug wills has total editorial control over the independent highlighted as some of the worst offenders in media complacency with ongoing genocide by Novara Media metastudy",
